==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY Promo|Slurpuff|15}}, one of the {{TCG|XY Black Star Promos}}.
*'''Magical Shot''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Ancient Origins|Ralts|52}} and {{TCG ID|Ancient Origins|Kirlia|53}} from the {{TCG|Ancient Origins}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

